---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { unlicensed } from '../data/site';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Free trial"
  description="Try Jurnl, payroll and accounting for Australian small businesses, free on Windows or Mac. Register your interest and we'll send you the download link."
  intro="Try Jurnl with your own business, free, on Windows or Mac."
>
  <p>Fill in the short form and we'll email you a link to download Jurnl. No card and no account needed.</p>

  <form class="form" method="post" action="/api/trial" data-form data-thanks="/download/thanks/">
    <div class="field">
      <label for="t-name">Name</label>
      <input id="t-name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required />
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <label for="t-email">Email</label>
      <input id="t-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required />
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <label for="t-business">Business name (optional)</label>
      <input id="t-business" name="business" type="text" autocomplete="organization" />
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <label for="t-staff">How many people do you pay?</label>
      <select id="t-staff" name="staff">
        <option>Just me</option>
        <option>2 to 5</option>
        <option>6 to 20</option>
        <option>More than 20</option>
      </select>
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <label for="t-platform">Your computer</label>
      <select id="t-platform" name="platform">
        <option>Windows</option>
        <option>Mac</option>
      </select>
    </div>
    <div class="hp" aria-hidden="true">
      <label for="company_website">Leave this empty</label>
      <input id="company_website" name="company_website" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
    </div>
    <p class="muted" style="font-size: 0.875rem">We use your details only to send the trial and help you with Jurnl. See our <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.</p>
    <button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit" style="justify-self: start">Send me the download link</button>
    <p class="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  </form>

  <h2>The free trial</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Free to use with {unlicensed.text}.</strong> A free trial licence lifts the limits.</li>
    <li><strong>Everything works,</strong> with Single Touch Payroll through the ATO's Single Touch Lite file until direct lodgement from Jurnl is approved.</li>
    <li><strong>Jurnl keeps itself up to date,</strong> backing up your database before every update.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What you'll need</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>A Windows 10 or 11 computer (64-bit), or a Mac with Apple silicon (M1 or later).</li>
    <li><strong>If you work alone,</strong> nothing else: keep the company in a folder on your own computer. Jurnl copies your backups to a second place you choose, such as a USB drive.</li>
    <li><strong>If others will work on it,</strong> a shared folder that everyone syncs from the same provider, for example all on OneDrive or all on Dropbox.</li>
    <li>Your ABN and bank details to set up your company. The setup wizard walks you through the rest.</li>
  </ul>
</PageLayout>
